🔧 Key Features
Navigation Bar with links: Home, About, Work, Resume, Contact.

About Section describing who I am and what I do.

Work Section showcasing sample projects or experiences.

Resume Section with relevant background or a downloadable CV.

Contact Form using HTML <form> elements for user interaction.

Embedded Video or Audio using <video> or <audio> tags.

Table and List elements to display organized data.

Footer with additional links or information.

Linked to an external CSS file (styles.css) for styling.

🎨 Styling
Navigation bar styled as inline.

Font set to Roboto.

Classes used to target specific sections for custom design.

Responsive layout using proper HTML structure.


